  (text "Notes: (a) Symbol MAX481E used for THVD1450DR (identical 8-pin RS485 pinout). (b) TLV62568DBV symbol used for TLV62569DBVR (same pinout).\n(c) 74LS245 symbol used for SN74HCT245PWR and 74LVC1G08 symbol used for the 74AHCT1G08 gates U9/U10/U19 (same pinout).\n(d) K1 is the external DIN contactor LC1D09BD (24 VDC coil); only its coil terminals reach this PCB. The motor power path (K1 contacts -> IBT-2 module B+/B- -> motor) does NOT pass over this PCB.\n(e) Values marked * are design targets - verify against datasheets during layout. (f) GPIO3/45/46 (straps) and GPIO35-37 (octal PSRAM on N16R8) left unconnected; module is the BOM part N16R8, the N8 is footprint- and pin-compatible." (at 20 560 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid c66e39c9-a044-461f-98a0-f4c5b388f9df))
