  (text "K1 = external DIN contactor Schneider LC1D09BD (24 VDC coil); its contacts switch the +24V line to the IBT-2 module B+ (off this PCB). E-stop (BOM: ProMax 22 mm 2-pole, contacts 1 A DC)\nNC contact in series with the coil supply: pressing it de-energises K1 and removes motor power regardless of firmware; ESTOP_OK also forces the IBT-2 R_EN/L_EN and RPWM low via U9/U19.\nThe contactor coil current (about 0.2 A at 24 V, assumed, to be confirmed on the datasheet) is carried by J4.1 / the E-stop contact, which is rated 1 A DC." (at 20 430 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid f30f69c2-2104-488d-847f-f0733ed75c46))
