  (text "J5: limit switches (BOM: ME-8108) wired on the NC contact between +24V_FIELD (J5.1) and IN_LIM_x (open = limit reached or wire break -> LOW -> safe); confirm the NC terminal on the real part.\nIN_BEAM: the BOM through-beam receiver (Delta PS-MT5 series, PNP) drives 24 V onto IN_BEAM when the beam is clear (light-ON) -> compatible with the active-high input; break / loss of supply = LOW = blocked (fail-safe). Confirm light-ON/NO output on the real part.\nJ6: dry contacts closed to +24V_FIELD (J6.3) = OK; no AC-OK / BAT-OK source device is in the BOM (LRS-150/200-24 has no status output): link J6.1 to J6.3 to disable mains-loss sensing in the baseline." (at 515 480 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid b842f123-2147-44c3-af7c-0e97ebe64807))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
